      "writtenOn": "2017-10-18T19:45:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the problem here is that you are filtering the transitive dependencies by the declared dependencies too early.  The filtering should only happen for the linking, not for propagating the dependency order:\n\nFor the dependency graph A-\u003e[B,C,D], B-\u003e[C]; C-\u003e[D]:\nC.orderedTransitiveDeps \u003d [D]\nB.orderedTransitiveDeps \u003d [C, D] // even though B doesn\u0027t declare a dependency on D\nA.orderedTranstiiveDeps \u003d [B, C, D]",
      "parentUuid": "fb7bb7a0_f4ff313f",
      "revId": "d4f0f3081f4a19fab2d9f845bfb667975735af28",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
